    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n*QUALIFIES FOR THE VACANT PROPERTY GRANT UP TO 50,000*Welcome to 57 The Heath in the highly sought after estate of Belgard Heights.This detached home briefly comprises of an entrance hallway, open plan dining and living rooms with newly fitted carpets, kitchen, guest w/c, downstairs double bedroom with ensuite shower. Upstairs comprises of three double bedrooms, one single bedroom and main bathroom. The property benefits from a large back garden, off-street parking and a large garage/workshop.The location is second to none, being located in a quiet established neighbourhood while also being a short walk from city access through the Luas which is less than a 5 minute walk away as well as regional routes from the M50. Other nearby amenities include St. Killian's primary school, Belgard primary school along with a host of amenities in Belgard. Call or email for viewing details."
